<title>USA: Audio King Jan. same-store sales decline.</title>
<headline>Audio King Jan. same-store sales decline.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audio King Corp, a specialty electronics retailer, said Thursday its January same-store sales declined four percent compared to the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Total sales for the month were $5,836,000 compared to $5,848,000 in January 1996.</p>
<p>Year-to-date sales for the seven months ended January 1997 were up one percent at $41.2 million versus $40.8 million for the same 1996 period. Year-to-date comparable-store sales decreased one percent.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
